  "body": "I've been having the same behavior for a while now and decided to try to get some more info on what actually causes it. Just opening an image and closing it is fine, it releases the handle. However, if I open an image and modify it, it's now locked until ART closes. For example, double click an image to edit it, drag the exposure slider, now it's locked. I think this can occur with any image type, in my case it's a jpg.",
